  "notes": "Compound of {放|ほう} (release) + {電|でん} (electricity). The opposite of {充電|じゅうでん} (charging).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {放電|ほうでん}する — to discharge (する verb)\n- {自然|しぜん}{放電|ほうでん} — natural discharge, self-discharge\n- {放電|ほうでん}{現象|げんしょう} — discharge phenomenon\n- {過|か}{放電|ほうでん} — over-discharge (damaging a battery by draining it too far)\n\nRELATED TERMS:\n- {充電|じゅうでん} — charging (opposite)\n- {蓄電|ちくでん} — storing electricity\n- {感電|かんでん} — electric shock (receiving a discharge)",
